  message: "All 10 children closed. Sub-METAs: INV-fosab (kind-segregated registry, satisfied) and INV-zadum (write-side identity contract, satisfied). Atomic children all satisfied/done: INV-vaguj (orchestrator path/span fix), INV-sopon (linker origin stamp across 19/21 files), INV-hojus (Python file/module double-representation), INV-kokaj (cross-language file-canonical sibling), INV-mopif (HTTP linker verb-prefixed function names), INV-ronuf (websocket phantom file Symbols), INV-zuhub (linker simple-name fallback confidence calibration), WI-higap (Edge.origin_run_id provenance). Symbol identity is now honest about its uncertainty across write / read / edge / provenance / representation. File_id-shape identity family closed across audited linkers (websocket, js_module, vue_component) per sibling tasks INV-ronuf, INV-movor, INV-bahov."  # 44ab
